  "ruleText": "He-P 809.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to set forth the licensing requirements for all home health care providers (HHCPs) pursuant to RSA 151:2, I(b).\n\nSource. #4073, eff 6-26-86, EXPIRED: 6-26-92\n\nNew. #5630, eff 5-26-93; amd by #6240, HB 32, eff 5-3-96, EXPIRED 12-31-98; ss and amd by #7006, INTERIM, eff 5-26-99, EXPIRED: 9-23-99\n\nNew. #9466, eff 5-2-09; ss by #12167, INTERIM, eff 4-29-17, EXPIRED: 10-26-17\n\nNew. #12640, eff 10-3-18",
